:"U03C6TEAZ","text":"食栄養に詳しいゴリラ。","ts":"1624978659.168400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gorilla","count":1,"users":["U023FDA0AKC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XQTgv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a7bc246-9855-4872-9895-b6f164b419db","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"卵・魚・大豆・乳製品などタンパク質源はいろいろあるので，少し意識して量を増やすだけでだいぶいい感じです！","ts":"1624978634.167300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1YWBk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f30392d-b731-4ada-bbc4-ffcd9dbf1501","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"糖質とタンパク質をそれぞれ握りこぶし分くらい食べれば体にとっていい感じですね","ts":"1624978516.166200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4umK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c8d2b98-1360-4990-9b90-a2d4dc137f66","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"三食サラダチキン食べるくらいか。朝食べないから二食でとらないと。確かに辛い。","ts":"1624978513.166100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+x7c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f175befd-2378-4f66-9f92-a3382f4f838c","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"肉食べたい欲が最近下がってる気がする。","ts":"1624978425.164700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cNzUB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8443b217-7149-429c-9aed-b34503c79dbc","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"なるほど。","ts":"1624978353.163400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Lk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecd00cff-9e8a-4cc6-bbd8-842bba492387","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"鶏肉とか卵とか，あとは鶏肉とかチキンとか鶏の胸肉がいいですね","ts":"1624978320.163000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sEY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2f78914-a248-4ef8-ac41-d7354b372da1","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"ただ，タンパク質の1日の最低摂取目安の 1g x 体重/kg を接収するのはたぶん苦行です・・・","ts":"1624978251.162400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bT1zw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a36189f8-252c-44fc-90c9-237c3a0daf3e","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"(理論的には) 可能です","ts":"1624978151.160800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YA2M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b9e1c97-a024-4716-8e5f-e737882f5459","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"フルーツとチーズをガバガバ食べればいいかな。(適当)","ts":"1624977967.160600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e/i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fc80cc0-58b0-44e7-8101-99efa6ac9e1a","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"糖質とタンパク質をセットで1日3食，できれば2食を摂取し続ければ健康的に体重増やせそうです．\n糖質摂取で細胞に栄養を運ぶインスリンを分泌して，細胞の材料のアミノ酸 (タンパク質) を効率良く届けるという作戦です","ts":"1624977784.160100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9JLb0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe2de108-dc3f-400c-90de-08d75c336073","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"もう体重減らすつもりないので栄養補給の方法を考えた方が良さそう。","ts":"1624977494.157600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V=Ad/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0307725c-37eb-4037-a8e7-fa58cec96e6f","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"走りすぎると細胞内にある筋肉合成ストップ装置が働くので，そういう人の筋肉は減少の一途を辿りそうですね．．．","ts":"1624977418.156600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=gZH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d815459-5809-42e0-af30-3bbed622b2bf","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"もともと体脂肪は普通 (14 か 15) だったけど走っても大して変わってない (13 か 14) なので、筋肉が削げ落ちた可能性が高い。","ts":"1624977131.155000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WfAzQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba1e520c-728d-468b-a38f-15894f814814","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"(はじめまして，ゴリラ繋がりで思わずコメントしてしまいました)","ts":"1624976837.152700","edited":{"user":"U023FDA0AKC","ts":"1624976849.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"uhouho","count":6,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UFHQ7TNT0","U023040U953","UDDCM376D","U81LLJ340","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oXiE8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ab5b8a4-4d31-40f1-b7ad-2f9528abe415","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(全然関係ないけどゴリラが二人いて絵面がすごい)","ts":"1624976812.152200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U81LLJ340","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"22Gk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"315f3d40-e304-41db-883c-a86f2396d79d","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"運動を一定時間続けるとアミノ酸が使われ始めるのですが，血中にアミノ酸が無いと筋肉を分解して作り出します．\nなので，血中アミノ酸濃度を高めてから運動を始めれば筋肉の分解はかなり防げます！","ts":"1624976774.151900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U78UYGX8W"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K23"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16F48FAE-6370-4BC1-8F0C-122CE97F0FE2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"有酸素運はたくさんやると、筋肉が消費されてしまうらしい","ts":"1624975537.150300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TBibs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44254210-AF84-40B1-B4E3-150C15B69F68","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"女の子はその思考に結構至るみたいですね。","ts":"1624973263.149300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cud"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4321cdf-db00-4f97-9cd4-3429ed35a88e","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"だから肉体強化は大変なのだ(だった)","ts":"1624973040.148500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lQD2Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ebbefe3-ad1f-414f-83a0-b8fbb21bead6","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"筋トレはよっぽどやり込まない限りそ～んな太くなることは無いですね","ts":"1624973012.147900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BREux"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab549300-209c-4fec-8541-65e1d2f39891","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"まー時々トレーニングや運動してムキムキになったらどうしようとかいい出す人居るけど\nちょっとやそっとで簡単に体型変わったりムキムキにはならんので安心しろってやつ","ts":"1624972912.147200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":7,"users":["U01J7703PFT","U01PMN2BVJQ","U013QL1RAPN","U023BKJSB40","U81LLJ340","UDDCM376D","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UNHk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"900d115a-6212-4726-8364-7c32de48d7bd","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"健康診断の結果は比較的良くなりそうな職場だ・・・進捗は知らない","ts":"1624971735.145500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JJ3y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c78d104b-a29b-4a65-aa08-1af1ba495511","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"「まだ目標まで2kmあるんで残業します」","ts":"1624971642.145000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MLBT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe02088a-531e-43ec-b13a-6c288a3427ad","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"今日の発言は走行距離キロ数分の票が投票できます!","ts":"1624971298.140400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s/oq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6d5a5ed-419f-4ea7-ad62-836fa094883e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"仕事にならないやつw","ts":"1624971257.139100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kA8Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d64967c5-f79d-4447-bc6d-4ed82fcb384a","type":"message","us