ったですね……。","ts":"1624953394.104900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P9qi7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"664fe859-a272-4268-9e5d-f97fe5263d9e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"手術キッツ","ts":"1624953326.104000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SDIu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56c9e2fc-b742-43a8-8575-367300678793","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"取れなかったのがあるのはつらいな...","ts":"1624953280.103300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N1y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99ace346-1260-4994-98c0-6c9b9428fd45","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"私は痔瘻で手術しましたが、中々地獄でしたね……。術前・術中に発見できなかった瘻孔の分岐があって、そっちが膿んで三日三晩40度の熱が出たあと再手術しました。","ts":"1624953259.102900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hiee","count":7,"users":["U01PMN2BVJQ","U011FTGJ3SN","U7JL1UKKL","U017BU3UZBQ","UL6CFN8NR","U013QL1RAPN","UQX22KG9F"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yzo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d7c6327-7a44-4e8a-a336-53a2e4f30a2e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分はカメラOnlyゆえの鎮痛剤ありだったが、大変だなあ","ts":"1624953209.101900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NFHLG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4D07E656-E595-47A6-B8EF-E9EE9E5BAA41","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"怖すぎる・・。大腸カメラもキツかったのにこれはヤバい・・。","ts":"1624953098.101000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LfwQx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68cd3a53-447f-459c-9192-0a32ed305a72","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"続編か","ts":"1624952182.099600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"obu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43fbd27c-43d8-45b2-b581-9565075f80e2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"怖い","ts":"1624952059.099400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ewtw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d53b853-6d1e-4fc4-a764-32b68d22a81b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://note.com/sonson/n/nc518a3dcd9cb|https://note.com/sonson/n/nc518a3dcd9cb\u003e","ts":"1624952056.099100","attachments":[{"fallback":"note（ノート）: 人生で初めて２週間も入院した話：後編｜sonson｜note","id":1,"title":"人生で初めて２週間も入院した話：後編｜sonson｜note","title_link":"https://note.com/sonson/n/nc518a3dcd9cb","text":"前編 というわけで，私は，大腸カメラと痔の手術を受けることにした．入院期間は，10〜14日を見た方がいいとのことであった．普段，後輩たちに「命あってのモノダネ．体壊して手に入れたものに意味なんてねぇ．しんどければ休め，温泉でも行ってこい」と言い続けてる私が10日も有給を取って休むことになったのだった．さて・・・・・とにかく手術である． 大腸カメラと手術 手術前日に入院し，入院日に大腸カメラを受けることになった．大腸カメラ当日は，朝から，ポカリスエットを海水でわったようなあの薬を２Lほど飲み干し，腸内を洗浄することになる．一度でも，下部消化器の内視鏡検査をやったことがある人なら経","image_url":"https://assets.st-note.com/production/uploads/images/55508057/rectangle_large_type_2_9775eb7639ac81dc7211e73c8ddee6aa.jpeg?fit=bounds\u0026quality=85\u0026width=1280","blocks":null,"service_name":"note（ノート）","service_icon":"https://d291vdycu0ht11.cloudfront.net/nuxt/static/metaicon/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://note.com/sonson/n/nc518a3dcd9cb","original_url":"https://note.com/sonson/n/nc518a3dcd9cb"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vCAO"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UR199T8TS","text":"\u003c@UR199T8TS\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1624927029.098300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"5aa99771-8b01-4830-88ae-43a9f40cee8c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"仕事終わるの、大体深夜なのでバテた状態で筋トレするより\n朝回復した状態で筋トレしたほうが断然力が出ている感がある","ts":"1624925539.098000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"chTL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"084fa8d0-9e8d-408c-af87-e7ef47298ffc","type":